-- SGU MSA website: the database, part 3 of 4 (the fixed Qur'an verse library; review 3 E, ADR 0026).
-- Run after 202610150002_starter_data.sql.
--
-- Every whole verse whose Arabic fits one line where a verse shows (at most 29 letters, spaces and signs,
-- harakat not counted: `fitsOneLine(arabicEmEstimate(arabic))` in src/shared/ui/arabicFit.ts, about
-- 11.47em at 0.39em per letter), 1655 of the Qur'an's 6236, as api.alquran.cloud gave them (quran-uthmani
-- + en.sahih; the basmala before a surah's first verse left out, except 1:1). Fetched once by
-- `npx tsx scripts/page-text-seed.mjs --fetch-verses` into src/lib/quran/verse-library.json and generated
-- from it by `npx tsx scripts/page-text-seed.mjs --verses` (tests/verse-library-migration.test.ts checks
-- the two agree). The table has no write grant: this is the only time verses are added.
