  (11, 75, $seed$Hud$seed$, $seed$إِنَّ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ لَحَلِيمٌ أَوَّٰهٌۭ مُّنِيبٌۭ$seed$, $seed$Indeed, Abraham was forbearing, grieving and [frequently] returning [to Allah].$seed$),
  (11, 104, $seed$Hud$seed$, $seed$وَمَا نُؤَخِّرُهُۥٓ إِلَّا لِأَجَلٍۢ مَّعْدُودٍۢ$seed$, $seed$And We do not delay it except for a limited term.$seed$),
