  (15, 35, $seed$Al-Hijr$seed$, $seed$وَإِنَّ عَلَيْكَ ٱللَّعْنَةَ إِلَىٰ يَوْمِ ٱلدِّينِ$seed$, $seed$And indeed, upon you is the curse until the Day of Recompense."$seed$),
