  (15, 64, $seed$Al-Hijr$seed$, $seed$وَأَتَيْنَٰكَ بِٱلْحَقِّ وَإِنَّا لَصَٰدِقُونَ$seed$, $seed$And we have come to you with truth, and indeed, we are truthful.$seed$),
