  (15, 78, $seed$Al-Hijr$seed$, $seed$وَإِن كَانَ أَصْحَٰبُ ٱلْأَيْكَةِ لَظَٰلِمِينَ$seed$, $seed$And the companions of the thicket were [also] wrongdoers.$seed$),
  (15, 80, $seed$Al-Hijr$seed$, $seed$وَلَقَدْ كَذَّبَ أَصْحَٰبُ ٱلْحِجْرِ ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ$seed$, $seed$And certainly did the companions of Thamud deny the messengers.$seed$),
  (15, 83, $seed$Al-Hijr$seed$, $seed$فَأَخَذَتْهُمُ ٱلصَّيْحَةُ مُصْبِحِينَ$seed$, $seed$But the shriek seized them at early morning.$seed$),
