  (15, 90, $seed$Al-Hijr$seed$, $seed$كَمَآ أَنزَلْنَا عَلَى ٱلْمُقْتَسِمِينَ$seed$, $seed$Just as We had revealed [scriptures] to the separators$seed$),
  (15, 91, $seed$Al-Hijr$seed$, $seed$ٱلَّذِينَ جَعَلُوا۟ ٱلْقُرْءَانَ عِضِينَ$seed$, $seed$Who have made the Qur'an into portions.$seed$),
  (15, 92, $seed$Al-Hijr$seed$, $seed$فَوَرَبِّكَ لَنَسْـَٔلَنَّهُمْ أَجْمَعِينَ$seed$, $seed$So by your Lord, We will surely question them all$seed$),
  (15, 93, $seed$Al-Hijr$seed$, $seed$عَمَّا كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ$seed$, $seed$About what they used to do.$seed$),
  (15, 95, $seed$Al-Hijr$seed$, $seed$إِنَّا كَفَيْنَٰكَ ٱلْمُسْتَهْزِءِينَ$seed$, $seed$Indeed, We are sufficient for you against the mockers$seed$),
  (15, 98, $seed$Al-Hijr$seed$, $seed$فَسَبِّحْ بِحَمْدِ رَبِّكَ وَكُن مِّنَ ٱلسَّٰجِدِينَ$seed$, $seed$So exalt [Allah] with praise of your Lord and be of those who prostrate [to Him].$seed$),
