  (16, 16, $seed$An-Nahl$seed$, $seed$وَعَلَٰمَٰتٍۢ ۚ وَبِٱلنَّجْمِ هُمْ يَهْتَدُونَ$seed$, $seed$And landmarks. And by the stars they are [also] guided.$seed$),
