  (16, 117, $seed$An-Nahl$seed$, $seed$مَتَٰعٌۭ قَلِيلٌۭ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌۭ$seed$, $seed$[It is but] a brief enjoyment, and they will have a painful punishment.$seed$),
