  (36, 17, $seed$Yaseen$seed$, $seed$وَمَا عَلَيْنَآ إِلَّا ٱلْبَلَٰغُ ٱلْمُبِينُ$seed$, $seed$And we are not responsible except for clear notification."$seed$),
