  (37, 112, $seed$As-Saaffaat$seed$, $seed$وَبَشَّرْنَٰهُ بِإِسْحَٰقَ نَبِيًّۭا مِّنَ ٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ$seed$, $seed$And We gave him good tidings of Isaac, a prophet from among the righteous.$seed$),
