  (37, 140, $seed$As-Saaffaat$seed$, $seed$إِذْ أَبَقَ إِلَى ٱلْفُلْكِ ٱلْمَشْحُونِ$seed$, $seed$[Mention] when he ran away to the laden ship.$seed$),
  (37, 141, $seed$As-Saaffaat$seed$, $seed$فَسَاهَمَ فَكَانَ مِنَ ٱلْمُدْحَضِينَ$seed$, $seed$And he drew lots and was among the losers.$seed$),
