  (37, 145, $seed$As-Saaffaat$seed$, $seed$۞ فَنَبَذْنَٰهُ بِٱلْعَرَآءِ وَهُوَ سَقِيمٌۭ$seed$, $seed$But We threw him onto the open shore while he was ill.$seed$),
