  (37, 151, $seed$As-Saaffaat$seed$, $seed$أَلَآ إِنَّهُم مِّنْ إِفْكِهِمْ لَيَقُولُونَ$seed$, $seed$Unquestionably, it is out of their [invented] falsehood that they say,$seed$),
  (37, 152, $seed$As-Saaffaat$seed$, $seed$وَلَدَ ٱللَّهُ وَإِنَّهُمْ لَكَٰذِبُونَ$seed$, $seed$" Allah has begotten," and indeed, they are liars.$seed$),
