  (37, 180, $seed$As-Saaffaat$seed$, $seed$سُبْحَٰنَ رَبِّكَ رَبِّ ٱلْعِزَّةِ عَمَّا يَصِفُونَ$seed$, $seed$Exalted is your Lord, the Lord of might, above what they describe.$seed$),
  (37, 181, $seed$As-Saaffaat$seed$, $seed$وَسَلَٰمٌ عَلَى ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ$seed$, $seed$And peace upon the messengers.$seed$),
