  (38, 1, $seed$Saad$seed$, $seed$صٓ ۚ وَٱلْقُرْءَانِ ذِى ٱلذِّكْرِ$seed$, $seed$Sad. By the Qur'an containing reminder...$seed$),
  (38, 2, $seed$Saad$seed$, $seed$بَلِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ فِى عِزَّةٍۢ وَشِقَاقٍۢ$seed$, $seed$But those who disbelieve are in pride and dissension.$seed$),
  (38, 11, $seed$Saad$seed$, $seed$جُندٌۭ مَّا هُنَالِكَ مَهْزُومٌۭ مِّنَ ٱلْأَحْزَابِ$seed$, $seed$[They are but] soldiers [who will be] defeated there among the companies [of disbelievers].$seed$),
