  (38, 68, $seed$Saad$seed$, $seed$أَنتُمْ عَنْهُ مُعْرِضُونَ$seed$, $seed$From which you turn away.$seed$),
  (38, 73, $seed$Saad$seed$, $seed$فَسَجَدَ ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ كُلُّهُمْ أَجْمَعُونَ$seed$, $seed$So the angels prostrated - all of them entirely.$seed$),
  (38, 77, $seed$Saad$seed$, $seed$قَالَ فَٱخْرُجْ مِنْهَا فَإِنَّكَ رَجِيمٌۭ$seed$, $seed$[Allah] said, "Then get out of Paradise, for indeed, you are expelled.$seed$),
  (38, 78, $seed$Saad$seed$, $seed$وَإِنَّ عَلَيْكَ لَعْنَتِىٓ إِلَىٰ يَوْمِ ٱلدِّينِ$seed$, $seed$And indeed, upon you is My curse until the Day of Recompense."$seed$),
