  (38, 81, $seed$Saad$seed$, $seed$إِلَىٰ يَوْمِ ٱلْوَقْتِ ٱلْمَعْلُومِ$seed$, $seed$Until the Day of the time well-known."$seed$),
  (38, 82, $seed$Saad$seed$, $seed$قَالَ فَبِعِزَّتِكَ لَأُغْوِيَنَّهُمْ أَجْمَعِينَ$seed$, $seed$[Iblees] said, "By your might, I will surely mislead them all$seed$),
  (38, 83, $seed$Saad$seed$, $seed$إِلَّا عِبَادَكَ مِنْهُمُ ٱلْمُخْلَصِينَ$seed$, $seed$Except, among them, Your chosen servants."$seed$),
  (38, 84, $seed$Saad$seed$, $seed$قَالَ فَٱلْحَقُّ وَٱلْحَقَّ أَقُولُ$seed$, $seed$[Allah] said, "The truth [is My oath], and the truth I say -$seed$),
  (38, 87, $seed$Saad$seed$, $seed$إِنْ هُوَ إِلَّا ذِكْرٌۭ لِّلْعَٰلَمِينَ$seed$, $seed$It is but a reminder to the worlds.$seed$),
  (38, 88, $seed$Saad$seed$, $seed$وَلَتَعْلَمُنَّ نَبَأَهُۥ بَعْدَ حِينٍۭ$seed$, $seed$And you will surely know [the truth of] its information after a time."$seed$),
  (39, 12, $seed$Az-Zumar$seed$, $seed$وَأُمِرْتُ لِأَنْ أَكُونَ أَوَّلَ ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ$seed$, $seed$And I have been commanded to be the first [among you] of the Muslims."$seed$),
