  (43, 6, $seed$Az-Zukhruf$seed$, $seed$وَكَمْ أَرْسَلْنَا مِن نَّبِىٍّۢ فِى ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ$seed$, $seed$And how many a prophet We sent among the former peoples,$seed$),
  (43, 14, $seed$Az-Zukhruf$seed$, $seed$وَإِنَّآ إِلَىٰ رَبِّنَا لَمُنقَلِبُونَ$seed$, $seed$And indeed we, to our Lord, will [surely] return."$seed$),
  (43, 27, $seed$Az-Zukhruf$seed$, $seed$إِلَّا ٱلَّذِى فَطَرَنِى فَإِنَّهُۥ سَيَهْدِينِ$seed$, $seed$Except for He who created me; and indeed, He will guide me."$seed$),
