  (43, 75, $seed$Az-Zukhruf$seed$, $seed$لَا يُفَتَّرُ عَنْهُمْ وَهُمْ فِيهِ مُبْلِسُونَ$seed$, $seed$It will not be allowed to subside for them, and they, therein, are in despair.$seed$),
