  (44, 20, $seed$Ad-Dukhaan$seed$, $seed$وَإِنِّى عُذْتُ بِرَبِّى وَرَبِّكُمْ أَن تَرْجُمُونِ$seed$, $seed$And indeed, I have sought refuge in my Lord and your Lord, lest you stone me.$seed$),
