  (44, 22, $seed$Ad-Dukhaan$seed$, $seed$فَدَعَا رَبَّهُۥٓ أَنَّ هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ قَوْمٌۭ مُّجْرِمُونَ$seed$, $seed$And [finally] he called to his Lord that these were a criminal people.$seed$),
