  (44, 27, $seed$Ad-Dukhaan$seed$, $seed$وَنَعْمَةٍۢ كَانُوا۟ فِيهَا فَٰكِهِينَ$seed$, $seed$And comfort wherein they were amused.$seed$),
  (44, 28, $seed$Ad-Dukhaan$seed$, $seed$كَذَٰلِكَ ۖ وَأَوْرَثْنَٰهَا قَوْمًا ءَاخَرِينَ$seed$, $seed$Thus. And We caused to inherit it another people.$seed$),
