  (50, 20, $seed$Qaaf$seed$, $seed$وَنُفِخَ فِى ٱلصُّورِ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ يَوْمُ ٱلْوَعِيدِ$seed$, $seed$And the Horn will be blown. That is the Day of [carrying out] the threat.$seed$),
