  (53, 47, $seed$An-Najm$seed$, $seed$وَأَنَّ عَلَيْهِ ٱلنَّشْأَةَ ٱلْأُخْرَىٰ$seed$, $seed$And that [incumbent] upon Him is the next creation$seed$),
  (53, 48, $seed$An-Najm$seed$, $seed$وَأَنَّهُۥ هُوَ أَغْنَىٰ وَأَقْنَىٰ$seed$, $seed$And that it is He who enriches and suffices$seed$),
