  (53, 50, $seed$An-Najm$seed$, $seed$وَأَنَّهُۥٓ أَهْلَكَ عَادًا ٱلْأُولَىٰ$seed$, $seed$And that He destroyed the first [people of] 'Aad$seed$),
  (53, 51, $seed$An-Najm$seed$, $seed$وَثَمُودَا۟ فَمَآ أَبْقَىٰ$seed$, $seed$And Thamud - and He did not spare [them] -$seed$),
