  (53, 54, $seed$An-Najm$seed$, $seed$فَغَشَّىٰهَا مَا غَشَّىٰ$seed$, $seed$And covered them by that which He covered.$seed$),
  (53, 55, $seed$An-Najm$seed$, $seed$فَبِأَىِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكَ تَتَمَارَىٰ$seed$, $seed$Then which of the favors of your Lord do you doubt?$seed$),
  (53, 56, $seed$An-Najm$seed$, $seed$هَٰذَا نَذِيرٌۭ مِّنَ ٱلنُّذُرِ ٱلْأُولَىٰٓ$seed$, $seed$This [Prophet] is a warner like the former warners.$seed$),
  (53, 57, $seed$An-Najm$seed$, $seed$أَزِفَتِ ٱلْءَازِفَةُ$seed$, $seed$The Approaching Day has approached.$seed$),
  (53, 58, $seed$An-Najm$seed$, $seed$لَيْسَ لَهَا مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ كَاشِفَةٌ$seed$, $seed$Of it, [from those] besides Allah, there is no remover.$seed$),
  (53, 59, $seed$An-Najm$seed$, $seed$أَفَمِنْ هَٰذَا ٱلْحَدِيثِ تَعْجَبُونَ$seed$, $seed$Then at this statement do you wonder?$seed$),
  (53, 60, $seed$An-Najm$seed$, $seed$وَتَضْحَكُونَ وَلَا تَبْكُونَ$seed$, $seed$And you laugh and do not weep$seed$),
  (53, 61, $seed$An-Najm$seed$, $seed$وَأَنتُمْ سَٰمِدُونَ$seed$, $seed$While you are proudly sporting?$seed$),
