  (54, 1, $seed$Al-Qamar$seed$, $seed$ٱقْتَرَبَتِ ٱلسَّاعَةُ وَٱنشَقَّ ٱلْقَمَرُ$seed$, $seed$The Hour has come near, and the moon has split [in two].$seed$),
  (54, 5, $seed$Al-Qamar$seed$, $seed$حِكْمَةٌۢ بَٰلِغَةٌۭ ۖ فَمَا تُغْنِ ٱلنُّذُرُ$seed$, $seed$Extensive wisdom - but warning does not avail [them].$seed$),
