  (56, 3, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$خَافِضَةٌۭ رَّافِعَةٌ$seed$, $seed$It will bring down [some] and raise up [others].$seed$),
  (56, 4, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$إِذَا رُجَّتِ ٱلْأَرْضُ رَجًّۭا$seed$, $seed$When the earth is shaken with convulsion$seed$),
