  (56, 7, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$وَكُنتُمْ أَزْوَٰجًۭا ثَلَٰثَةًۭ$seed$, $seed$And you become [of] three kinds:$seed$),
  (56, 8, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$فَأَصْحَٰبُ ٱلْمَيْمَنَةِ مَآ أَصْحَٰبُ ٱلْمَيْمَنَةِ$seed$, $seed$Then the companions of the right - what are the companions of the right?$seed$),
  (56, 9, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$وَأَصْحَٰبُ ٱلْمَشْـَٔمَةِ مَآ أَصْحَٰبُ ٱلْمَشْـَٔمَةِ$seed$, $seed$And the companions of the left - what are the companions of the left?$seed$),
  (56, 10, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$وَٱلسَّٰبِقُونَ ٱلسَّٰبِقُونَ$seed$, $seed$And the forerunners, the forerunners -$seed$),
  (56, 11, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ ٱلْمُقَرَّبُونَ$seed$, $seed$Those are the ones brought near [to Allah]$seed$),
  (56, 12, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$فِى جَنَّٰتِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ$seed$, $seed$In the Gardens of Pleasure,$seed$),
  (56, 13, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$ثُلَّةٌۭ مِّنَ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ$seed$, $seed$A [large] company of the former peoples$seed$),
