  (56, 16, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$مُّتَّكِـِٔينَ عَلَيْهَا مُتَقَٰبِلِينَ$seed$, $seed$Reclining on them, facing each other.$seed$),
  (56, 17, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$يَطُوفُ عَلَيْهِمْ وِلْدَٰنٌۭ مُّخَلَّدُونَ$seed$, $seed$There will circulate among them young boys made eternal$seed$),
  (56, 18, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$بِأَكْوَابٍۢ وَأَبَارِيقَ وَكَأْسٍۢ مِّن مَّعِينٍۢ$seed$, $seed$With vessels, pitchers and a cup [of wine] from a flowing spring -$seed$),
