  (56, 30, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$وَظِلٍّۢ مَّمْدُودٍۢ$seed$, $seed$And shade extended$seed$),
  (56, 31, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$وَمَآءٍۢ مَّسْكُوبٍۢ$seed$, $seed$And water poured out$seed$),
