  (56, 34, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$وَفُرُشٍۢ مَّرْفُوعَةٍ$seed$, $seed$And [upon] beds raised high.$seed$),
  (56, 35, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$إِنَّآ أَنشَأْنَٰهُنَّ إِنشَآءًۭ$seed$, $seed$Indeed, We have produced the women of Paradise in a [new] creation$seed$),
  (56, 36, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$فَجَعَلْنَٰهُنَّ أَبْكَارًا$seed$, $seed$And made them virgins,$seed$),
