  (56, 38, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$لِّأَصْحَٰبِ ٱلْيَمِينِ$seed$, $seed$For the companions of the right [who are]$seed$),
  (56, 39, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$ثُلَّةٌۭ مِّنَ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ$seed$, $seed$A company of the former peoples$seed$),
