  (56, 41, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$وَأَصْحَٰبُ ٱلشِّمَالِ مَآ أَصْحَٰبُ ٱلشِّمَالِ$seed$, $seed$And the companions of the left - what are the companions of the left?$seed$),
  (56, 42, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$فِى سَمُومٍۢ وَحَمِيمٍۢ$seed$, $seed$[They will be] in scorching fire and scalding water$seed$),
  (56, 43, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$وَظِلٍّۢ مِّن يَحْمُومٍۢ$seed$, $seed$And a shade of black smoke,$seed$),
  (56, 44, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$لَّا بَارِدٍۢ وَلَا كَرِيمٍ$seed$, $seed$Neither cool nor beneficial.$seed$),
  (56, 45, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$إِنَّهُمْ كَانُوا۟ قَبْلَ ذَٰلِكَ مُتْرَفِينَ$seed$, $seed$Indeed they were, before that, indulging in affluence,$seed$),
