  (56, 80, $seed$Al-Waaqia$seed$, $seed$تَنزِيلٌۭ مِّن رَّبِّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ$seed$, $seed$[It is] a revelation from the Lord of the worlds.$seed$),
