  (68, 3, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$وَإِنَّ لَكَ لَأَجْرًا غَيْرَ مَمْنُونٍۢ$seed$, $seed$And indeed, for you is a reward uninterrupted.$seed$),
