  (68, 9, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$وَدُّوا۟ لَوْ تُدْهِنُ فَيُدْهِنُونَ$seed$, $seed$They wish that you would soften [in your position], so they would soften [toward you].$seed$),
