  (68, 11, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$هَمَّازٍۢ مَّشَّآءٍۭ بِنَمِيمٍۢ$seed$, $seed$[And] scorner, going about with malicious gossip -$seed$),
  (68, 12, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$مَّنَّاعٍۢ لِّلْخَيْرِ مُعْتَدٍ أَثِيمٍ$seed$, $seed$A preventer of good, transgressing and sinful,$seed$),
  (68, 13, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$عُتُلٍّۭ بَعْدَ ذَٰلِكَ زَنِيمٍ$seed$, $seed$Cruel, moreover, and an illegitimate pretender.$seed$),
  (68, 14, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$أَن كَانَ ذَا مَالٍۢ وَبَنِينَ$seed$, $seed$Because he is a possessor of wealth and children,$seed$),
  (68, 16, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$سَنَسِمُهُۥ عَلَى ٱلْخُرْطُومِ$seed$, $seed$We will brand him upon the snout.$seed$),
  (68, 18, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$وَلَا يَسْتَثْنُونَ$seed$, $seed$Without making exception.$seed$),
  (68, 20, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$فَأَصْبَحَتْ كَٱلصَّرِيمِ$seed$, $seed$And it became as though reaped.$seed$),
