  (68, 23, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$فَٱنطَلَقُوا۟ وَهُمْ يَتَخَٰفَتُونَ$seed$, $seed$So they set out, while lowering their voices,$seed$),
  (68, 25, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$وَغَدَوْا۟ عَلَىٰ حَرْدٍۢ قَٰدِرِينَ$seed$, $seed$And they went early in determination, [assuming themselves] able.$seed$),
  (68, 26, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$فَلَمَّا رَأَوْهَا قَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّا لَضَآلُّونَ$seed$, $seed$But when they saw it, they said, "Indeed, we are lost;$seed$),
  (68, 27, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$بَلْ نَحْنُ مَحْرُومُونَ$seed$, $seed$Rather, we have been deprived."$seed$),
  (68, 29, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$قَالُوا۟ سُبْحَٰنَ رَبِّنَآ إِنَّا كُنَّا ظَٰلِمِينَ$seed$, $seed$They said, "Exalted is our Lord! Indeed, we were wrongdoers."$seed$),
  (68, 30, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$فَأَقْبَلَ بَعْضُهُمْ عَلَىٰ بَعْضٍۢ يَتَلَٰوَمُونَ$seed$, $seed$Then they approached one another, blaming each other.$seed$),
  (68, 31, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$قَالُوا۟ يَٰوَيْلَنَآ إِنَّا كُنَّا طَٰغِينَ$seed$, $seed$They said, "O woe to us; indeed we were transgressors.$seed$),
  (68, 35, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$أَفَنَجْعَلُ ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ كَٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ$seed$, $seed$Then will We treat the Muslims like the criminals?$seed$),
  (68, 36, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$مَا لَكُمْ كَيْفَ تَحْكُمُونَ$seed$, $seed$What is [the matter] with you? How do you judge?$seed$),
  (68, 37, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$أَمْ لَكُمْ كِتَٰبٌۭ فِيهِ تَدْرُسُونَ$seed$, $seed$Or do you have a scripture in which you learn$seed$),
  (68, 38, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$إِنَّ لَكُمْ فِيهِ لَمَا تَخَيَّرُونَ$seed$, $seed$That indeed for you is whatever you choose?$seed$),
  (68, 40, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$سَلْهُمْ أَيُّهُم بِذَٰلِكَ زَعِيمٌ$seed$, $seed$Ask them which of them, for that [claim], is responsible.$seed$),
  (68, 45, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$وَأُمْلِى لَهُمْ ۚ إِنَّ كَيْدِى مَتِينٌ$seed$, $seed$And I will give them time. Indeed, My plan is firm.$seed$),
  (68, 47, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$أَمْ عِندَهُمُ ٱلْغَيْبُ فَهُمْ يَكْتُبُونَ$seed$, $seed$Or have they [knowledge of] the unseen, so they write [it] down?$seed$),
  (68, 50, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$فَٱجْتَبَٰهُ رَبُّهُۥ فَجَعَلَهُۥ مِنَ ٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ$seed$, $seed$And his Lord chose him and made him of the righteous.$seed$),
  (68, 52, $seed$Al-Qalam$seed$, $seed$وَمَا هُوَ إِلَّا ذِكْرٌۭ لِّلْعَٰلَمِينَ$seed$, $seed$But it is not except a reminder to the worlds.$seed$),
  (69, 1, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$ٱلْحَآقَّةُ$seed$, $seed$The Inevitable Reality -$seed$),
  (69, 2, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$مَا ٱلْحَآقَّةُ$seed$, $seed$What is the Inevitable Reality?$seed$),
  (69, 3, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْحَآقَّةُ$seed$, $seed$And what can make you know what is the Inevitable Reality?$seed$),
  (69, 4, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$كَذَّبَتْ ثَمُودُ وَعَادٌۢ بِٱلْقَارِعَةِ$seed$, $seed$Thamud and 'Aad denied the Striking Calamity.$seed$),
  (69, 5, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$فَأَمَّا ثَمُودُ فَأُهْلِكُوا۟ بِٱلطَّاغِيَةِ$seed$, $seed$So as for Thamud, they were destroyed by the overpowering [blast].$seed$),
  (69, 8, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$فَهَلْ تَرَىٰ لَهُم مِّنۢ بَاقِيَةٍۢ$seed$, $seed$Then do you see of them any remains?$seed$),
  (69, 13, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$فَإِذَا نُفِخَ فِى ٱلصُّورِ نَفْخَةٌۭ وَٰحِدَةٌۭ$seed$, $seed$Then when the Horn is blown with one blast$seed$),
  (69, 15, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$فَيَوْمَئِذٍۢ وَقَعَتِ ٱلْوَاقِعَةُ$seed$, $seed$Then on that Day, the Resurrection will occur,$seed$),
  (69, 16, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$وَٱنشَقَّتِ ٱلسَّمَآءُ فَهِىَ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ وَاهِيَةٌۭ$seed$, $seed$And the heaven will split [open], for that Day it is infirm.$seed$),
  (69, 20, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$إِنِّى ظَنَنتُ أَنِّى مُلَٰقٍ حِسَابِيَهْ$seed$, $seed$Indeed, I was certain that I would be meeting my account."$seed$),
  (69, 21, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$فَهُوَ فِى عِيشَةٍۢ رَّاضِيَةٍۢ$seed$, $seed$So he will be in a pleasant life -$seed$),
  (69, 22, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$فِى جَنَّةٍ عَالِيَةٍۢ$seed$, $seed$In an elevated garden,$seed$),
  (69, 23, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$قُطُوفُهَا دَانِيَةٌۭ$seed$, $seed$Its [fruit] to be picked hanging near.$seed$),
  (69, 26, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$وَلَمْ أَدْرِ مَا حِسَابِيَهْ$seed$, $seed$And had not known what is my account.$seed$),
  (69, 27, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$يَٰلَيْتَهَا كَانَتِ ٱلْقَاضِيَةَ$seed$, $seed$I wish my death had been the decisive one.$seed$),
  (69, 28, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$مَآ أَغْنَىٰ عَنِّى مَالِيَهْ ۜ$seed$, $seed$My wealth has not availed me.$seed$),
  (69, 29, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$هَلَكَ عَنِّى سُلْطَٰنِيَهْ$seed$, $seed$Gone from me is my authority."$seed$),
  (69, 30, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$خُذُوهُ فَغُلُّوهُ$seed$, $seed$[Allah will say], "Seize him and shackle him.$seed$),
  (69, 31, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$ثُمَّ ٱلْجَحِيمَ صَلُّوهُ$seed$, $seed$Then into Hellfire drive him.$seed$),
  (69, 33, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ لَا يُؤْمِنُ بِٱللَّهِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ$seed$, $seed$Indeed, he did not used to believe in Allah, the Most Great,$seed$),
  (69, 34, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$وَلَا يَحُضُّ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ ٱلْمِسْكِينِ$seed$, $seed$Nor did he encourage the feeding of the poor.$seed$),
  (69, 35, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$فَلَيْسَ لَهُ ٱلْيَوْمَ هَٰهُنَا حَمِيمٌۭ$seed$, $seed$So there is not for him here this Day any devoted friend$seed$),
  (69, 36, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$وَلَا طَعَامٌ إِلَّا مِنْ غِسْلِينٍۢ$seed$, $seed$Nor any food except from the discharge of wounds;$seed$),
  (69, 37, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$لَّا يَأْكُلُهُۥٓ إِلَّا ٱلْخَٰطِـُٔونَ$seed$, $seed$None will eat it except the sinners.$seed$),
  (69, 38, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$فَلَآ أُقْسِمُ بِمَا تُبْصِرُونَ$seed$, $seed$So I swear by what you see$seed$),
  (69, 39, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$وَمَا لَا تُبْصِرُونَ$seed$, $seed$And what you do not see$seed$),
  (69, 40, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوْلُ رَسُولٍۢ كَرِيمٍۢ$seed$, $seed$[That] indeed, the Qur'an is the word of a noble Messenger.$seed$),
  (69, 43, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$تَنزِيلٌۭ مِّن رَّبِّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ$seed$, $seed$[It is] a revelation from the Lord of the worlds.$seed$),
  (69, 44, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$وَلَوْ تَقَوَّلَ عَلَيْنَا بَعْضَ ٱلْأَقَاوِيلِ$seed$, $seed$And if Muhammad had made up about Us some [false] sayings,$seed$),
  (69, 45, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$لَأَخَذْنَا مِنْهُ بِٱلْيَمِينِ$seed$, $seed$We would have seized him by the right hand;$seed$),
  (69, 46, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$ثُمَّ لَقَطَعْنَا مِنْهُ ٱلْوَتِينَ$seed$, $seed$Then We would have cut from him the aorta.$seed$),
