  (69, 48, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$وَإِنَّهُۥ لَتَذْكِرَةٌۭ لِّلْمُتَّقِينَ$seed$, $seed$And indeed, the Qur'an is a reminder for the righteous.$seed$),
  (69, 49, $seed$Al-Haaqqa$seed$, $seed$وَإِنَّا لَنَعْلَمُ أَنَّ مِنكُم مُّكَذِّبِينَ$seed$, $seed$And indeed, We know that among you are deniers.$seed$),
