  (70, 1, $seed$Al-Ma'aarij$seed$, $seed$سَأَلَ سَآئِلٌۢ بِعَذَابٍۢ وَاقِعٍۢ$seed$, $seed$A supplicant asked for a punishment bound to happen$seed$),
