  (70, 12, $seed$Al-Ma'aarij$seed$, $seed$وَصَٰحِبَتِهِۦ وَأَخِيهِ$seed$, $seed$And his wife and his brother$seed$),
  (70, 13, $seed$Al-Ma'aarij$seed$, $seed$وَفَصِيلَتِهِ ٱلَّتِى تُـْٔوِيهِ$seed$, $seed$And his nearest kindred who shelter him$seed$),
  (70, 14, $seed$Al-Ma'aarij$seed$, $seed$وَمَن فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ جَمِيعًۭا ثُمَّ يُنجِيهِ$seed$, $seed$And whoever is on earth entirely [so] then it could save him.$seed$),
  (70, 15, $seed$Al-Ma'aarij$seed$, $seed$كَلَّآ ۖ إِنَّهَا لَظَىٰ$seed$, $seed$No! Indeed, it is the Flame [of Hell],$seed$),
  (70, 16, $seed$Al-Ma'aarij$seed$, $seed$نَزَّاعَةًۭ لِّلشَّوَىٰ$seed$, $seed$A remover of exteriors.$seed$),
