  (70, 24, $seed$Al-Ma'aarij$seed$, $seed$وَٱلَّذِينَ فِىٓ أَمْوَٰلِهِمْ حَقٌّۭ مَّعْلُومٌۭ$seed$, $seed$And those within whose wealth is a known right$seed$),
  (70, 25, $seed$Al-Ma'aarij$seed$, $seed$لِّلسَّآئِلِ وَٱلْمَحْرُومِ$seed$, $seed$For the petitioner and the deprived -$seed$),
