  (70, 27, $seed$Al-Ma'aarij$seed$, $seed$وَٱلَّذِينَ هُم مِّنْ عَذَابِ رَبِّهِم مُّشْفِقُونَ$seed$, $seed$And those who are fearful of the punishment of their Lord -$seed$),
  (70, 28, $seed$Al-Ma'aarij$seed$, $seed$إِنَّ عَذَابَ رَبِّهِمْ غَيْرُ مَأْمُونٍۢ$seed$, $seed$Indeed, the punishment of their Lord is not that from which one is safe -$seed$),
  (70, 29, $seed$Al-Ma'aarij$seed$, $seed$وَٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ لِفُرُوجِهِمْ حَٰفِظُونَ$seed$, $seed$And those who guard their private parts$seed$),
