  (70, 33, $seed$Al-Ma'aarij$seed$, $seed$وَٱلَّذِينَ هُم بِشَهَٰدَٰتِهِمْ قَآئِمُونَ$seed$, $seed$And those who are in their testimonies upright$seed$),
