  (70, 35, $seed$Al-Ma'aarij$seed$, $seed$أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ فِى جَنَّٰتٍۢ مُّكْرَمُونَ$seed$, $seed$They will be in gardens, honored.$seed$),
  (70, 36, $seed$Al-Ma'aarij$seed$, $seed$فَمَالِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ قِبَلَكَ مُهْطِعِينَ$seed$, $seed$So what is [the matter] with those who disbelieve, hastening [from] before you, [O Muhammad],$seed$),
  (70, 37, $seed$Al-Ma'aarij$seed$, $seed$عَنِ ٱلْيَمِينِ وَعَنِ ٱلشِّمَالِ عِزِينَ$seed$, $seed$[To sit] on [your] right and [your] left in separate groups?$seed$),
  (70, 39, $seed$Al-Ma'aarij$seed$, $seed$كَلَّآ ۖ إِنَّا خَلَقْنَٰهُم مِّمَّا يَعْلَمُونَ$seed$, $seed$No! Indeed, We have created them from that which they know.$seed$),
  (71, 2, $seed$Nooh$seed$, $seed$قَالَ يَٰقَوْمِ إِنِّى لَكُمْ نَذِيرٌۭ مُّبِينٌ$seed$, $seed$He said, "O my people, indeed I am to you a clear warner,$seed$),
  (71, 3, $seed$Nooh$seed$, $seed$أَنِ ٱعْبُدُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَٱتَّقُوهُ وَأَطِيعُونِ$seed$, $seed$[Saying], 'Worship Allah, fear Him and obey me.$seed$),
  (71, 6, $seed$Nooh$seed$, $seed$فَلَمْ يَزِدْهُمْ دُعَآءِىٓ إِلَّا فِرَارًۭا$seed$, $seed$But my invitation increased them not except in flight.$seed$),
